### ========== NewsPulse API 接口测试 ==========
### 运行前：.venv\Scripts\uvicorn main:app --reload
### 提示：先用「用户注册/登录」拿到 token，替换下方 {{token}} 的值

### 服务健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### 交互式 API 文档（浏览器打开）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

### ========== 用户模块 ==========

### 用户注册
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 用户登录（返回 token，复制到下方变量）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 获取当前用户信息（需认证）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改用户信息（需认证）
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "Alice",
  "bio": "FastAPI 学习者"
}

### 修改密码（需认证）
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "secret123",
  "new_password": "newsecret123"
}

### ========== 新闻模块 ==========

### 获取新闻分类
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/news/categories

### 获取新闻列表（全部，分页）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/news/list?page=1&pageSize=10

### 获取新闻列表（按分类筛选）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/news/list?categoryId=1&page=1&pageSize=5

### 获取新闻详情（浏览量+1，含相关推荐）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/news/detail?id=1

### ========== 收藏模块（需认证）==========

### 检查收藏状态
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/favorite/check?newsId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 添加收藏
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/favorite/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "news_id": 1
}

### 获取收藏列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/favorite/list?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 取消收藏
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/favorite/remove?newsId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清空收藏
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/favorite/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 浏览历史模块（需认证）==========

### 添加浏览历史
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "news_id": 2
}

### 获取浏览历史列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/list?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除单条浏览历史
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清空浏览历史
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== AI 问答 ==========
### 未配置 AI_API_KEY 时返回启用提示；配置后调用通义千问大模型

### AI 问答
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "FastAPI 是什么？用一句话介绍"
}
